msgid "provenance_heading"
msgstr "## Provenance"

msgid "provenance_statement"
msgstr "Every figure in this report was computed by a deterministic SQL query over the organization's own service data. No figure was written by a language model. Each figure carries a receipt below: the exact query, the count of rows it drew from, a content hash of that data slice, and a timestamp. The other numbers printed here, including those timestamps, row counts, hashes, and the numerals inside the queries and definitions, are receipt metadata rather than reported figures."

msgid "provenance_gate_pass_template"
msgstr "Before this report was exported, the grounding gate bound all {bound} of its numbers to a receipt; a number that traced to no receipt would have blocked the export."

msgid "provenance_gate_fail_template"
msgstr "The grounding gate left {unbound} number(s) unbound, so this report is not cleared for export."

msgid "provenance_approval_template"
msgstr "This report was reviewed and approved for export by {approver}{when}."

msgid "provenance_approval_when_template"
msgstr " on {timestamp}"

